# Desolace - Recipes & Patterns companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Only recipes and patterns whose SOURCE is physically in Desolace,
# verified against the local Forever game data (questie-forever item vendor
# and drop tables). Eighteen are vendor-sold by in-zone Alliance-buyable
# vendors (Super-Seller 680 and Vendor-Tron 1000, both neutral; Janet
# Hommers, Alliance; the Magram/Gelkis clan quartermasters Gorhak and
# Molkar, who carry no Horde flag); three are mob drops with sole
# droppers spawning only in-zone. Everything else Desolace-dropping is a
# generic multi-zone world drop (Elwynn rule, argued per case in the
# inventory), four in-zone-sold recipes are Horde-vendor exclusive, one
# narrow formula belongs to a Badlands-family mob with a single incidental
# Desolace point, and quest records carry no reward data, so neither ships
# (see docs/desolace-companions-inventory.md and
# docs/companion-unverified.md). Trainer-taught staples are excluded:
# Polestar's own profession guides cover those. Each step is gated to its
# profession; other characters skip it cleanly. Blacksmithing, First Aid
# and Fishing have no Desolace source, so that is stated, not padded.
guide butler-routes-completionist/desolace-recipes
title Desolace - Recipes & Patterns
levels 30-40
zone Desolace
faction Alliance
category Professions
folder Companions
keywords desolace, recipes, patterns, professions, companions
coords live
version 1

step Super-Seller 680 - bear, buzzard, wolf and chili (Cooking)

  zone map 1443

  when skill Cooking 1

  tip Super-Seller 680 (40.48, 79.27) sells the recipes; the shop is neutral, so Alliance characters can buy.
  buy 3734 "Recipe: Big Bear Steak"
  buy 4609 "Recipe: Barbecued Buzzard Wing"
  buy 12227 "Recipe: Lean Wolf Steak"
  buy 12229 "Recipe: Hot Wolf Ribs"
  buy 12239 "Recipe: Dragonbreath Chili"
  note Stock class is unconfirmed in the data (no limited flag either way).

