step Nijel's side - mystery and kodo stews (Cooking)

  zone map 1443

  when skill Cooking 1

  tip Janet Hommers (66.19, 6.57), Food & Drink, sells both recipes; Vendor-Tron 1000 (60.33, 38.12) sells them too and is neutral.
  buy 12233 "Recipe: Mystery Stew"
  buy 12240 "Recipe: Heavy Kodo Stew"
